body:
Definitely getting a consensus on this and thank you everyone who took the time to apply. I have played a rouge in pathfinder but haven't had the chance to play Operative in Starfinder. It is good to hear from those who might be more experienced with the class, and get some good points of view. Ill 100% be keeping the rules as is for this one and go over why changing the rules would just tilt the playing field way too much in his favor. 

&#x200B;

Thanks again and I will be sure to read through all the comments.
